{
  "id": "1TH.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "1TH",
  "reference": "1 Tesalonike 2",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TH 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, murazi neza ko ukubagendera kwacu kutabaye impfagusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’uko mubizi, twari twabanje kubabarizwa twongera ducokorerwa i Filipi, ariko Imana iduha gushira ubwoba, tubabwira Ubutumwa Bwiza naho twariko turagwanywa bikomeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubatera intege kwacu ntikwavuye ku buzimire canke ku ntumbero mbi twari dufise, kandi ntitwarondera kubahenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, twabigisha kuko twemewe n’Imana ikaba kandi yatujeje kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza. Ntituriko tugerageza kunezereza abantu, ariko dushaka kunezereza Imana, kuko ari yo isuzuma ivyiyumviro biri mu mitima yacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murazi ko tutigeze na rimwe dukoresha amajambo yo kubaryosharyosha gusa, canke ngo tugerageze kwiyerekana uko tutari, twironderera amaronko. Imana ni yo cabona cacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntitwigeze na rimwe turondera guhabwa icubahiro n’abantu, baba mwebwe, canke uwundi muntu uwo ari we wese, naho kubera turi intumwa za Kristo twari twemerewe kugira ivyo tubasavye dukoresheje ububasha dufise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahubwo, twicishije bugufi tumera nk’abana batoya muri mwebwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twari tumeze kurya kw’umuvyeyi ariko yitaho abana biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twarabakunze cane bituma tutababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana gusa, ahubwo twabahaye n’ubuzima bwacu na bwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta nkeka, bene Data, ko mwibuka uburuhe n’ukubabazwa vyacu; ingene twakora ijoro n’umurango kugira ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe turemera igihe twariko tubabwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe muri ivyabona hamwe n’Imana, vy’ingene twigenza hagati yanyu, twejejwe, tugororotse kandi turi inyankamugayo rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murazi ingene twafata umwumwe wese muri mwebwe nk’uko umuvyeyi afata abana biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twarabatera intege, tukabaremesha, tukabahimiriza ngo mubeho ubuzima bubereye abantu b’Imana, yo yabahamagariye kuba mu Bwami bwayo n’ubwiza vyayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turashima Imana kandi ko igihe mwakira ijambo ry’Imana mwatwumvanye, mutaryakiriye nk’amajambo asanzwe y’abantu, ariko mwaryakiriye nk’ijambo ry’Imana, nk’uko riri koko. Kandi iryo jambo ni ryo ribandanya gukorera muri mwebwe abizera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, namwe kubera mwemeye gufatira icitegererezo ku mashengero y’Imana ari i Yudaya arimwo abizera Yesu Kristo, ni co gituma muhamwa n’ab’iwanyu nk’uko ayo mashengero na yo yahamwe n’Abayuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ari bo bishe Umwami Yesu n’abavugishwa, natwe bakatwangaza. Babaye igisesema ku Mana, bongera baba abansi b’abantu bose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu kugerageza kutubuza kwigisha Abanyamahanga kugira ngo bakizwe. Mu gukora ivyo, birundanijeko ivyaha. Nico gituma uburake bw’Imana bwabashitseko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko bene Data, tumaze gutandukana vy’akanya gato (ku bw’imibiri atari ku bw’imitima), twakoze uko dushoboye kwose kugira ngo tugaruke kubagendera kuko twari tubakumbuye cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twaripfuje kuza iwanyu, kandi jewe Pawulo navyipfuje kenshi, ariko Satani aradutangira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega ikidutera ivyizigiro n’umunezero canke igitsibo tuzokwirata imbere y’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo igihe azozira ni ikihe? Si mwebwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ivy’ukuri, muri ubwiza n’umunezero vyacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
